6674793119988"],"id":"2111376674793119988","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":100,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Applied Materials、Lam","url":"https://x.com/got/status/2111376674793119988"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109938387583197184"]},"author_id":"2075042885888790528","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:01:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111744343241634079"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/e3QDxvQtSg","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111744343241634079/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109938387583197184","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/e3QDxvQtSg"}]},"id":"2111744343241634079","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":247,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"現代AI入門 #17｜AIを支える半導体 🤖\n\nChatGPTや画像・動画生成AIの進化を支えているのは、AIモデルの技術だけではありません。\n\nその裏側では、GPU・HBM・AI専用チップなどの半導体が重要な役割を担っています。\n\n今回は、AI半導体の仕組みと主要企業について解説します。\n\n① GPU｜AI計算の中心 https://t.co/e3QDxvQtSg","url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111744343241634079"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110812096644730880"]},"author_id":"2075042885888790528","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:01:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111246059934568608"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/prNsFiyjhi","end":169,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111246059934568608/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110812096644730880","start":146,"url":"https://t.co/prNsFiyjhi"}]},"id":"2111246059934568608","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":492,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【半導体初心者講座 #11】\n\n今回は「半導体製造装置とは？」です🔰\n\n半導体製造装置とは、半導体を加工・製造・検査するための機械のこと。\n\nNVIDIAやAMDが優れた半導体を設計しても、それを実際に作るためには高度な製造装置が欠かせません！\n\n🔹 主な製造装置の種類\n\n✅ 成膜装置\n→ https://t.co/prNsFiyjhi","url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111246059934568608"},{"author_id":"2070098022244237312","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:12:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["21112